BT 1 0 0 1 6 114.8 Tm /F4 7.6 Tf 10.2 TL (public int findContentChildren\(int[] g, int[] s\) { // g = children's greed factors, s = cookie sizes) Tj T* (    Arrays.sort\(g\);) Tj T* (    Arrays.sort\(s\);) Tj T* (    int child = 0, cookie = 0;) Tj T* (    while \(child < g.length && cookie < s.length\) {) Tj T* (        if \(s[cookie] >= g[child]\) {) Tj T* (            child++; // this cookie satisfies this child, greedily move to next child) Tj T* (        }) Tj T* (        cookie++; // this cookie is used up either way) Tj T* (    }) Tj T* (    return child;) Tj T* (}) Tj T* ET
Q
